WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.960
Welcome back to the Athleadership Arena.

00:10.960 --> 00:18.080
In our first lesson, you suited up to commit to your championship season.

00:18.080 --> 00:26.080
Today, we begin what every elite athlete undergoes before they ever step onto the field.

00:26.080 --> 00:28.720
Pre-season conditioning.

00:28.720 --> 00:30.680
This isn't about running laps.

00:30.680 --> 00:34.260
This is about deep inner work.

00:34.260 --> 00:41.280
Think of it as your rear-view mirror, a moment, a chance to look back, take the lessons from

00:41.280 --> 00:45.480
your life's journey, and make meaning from them.

00:45.480 --> 00:51.880
Before you begin to build a game plan for your future, you need a clear and honest scatter

00:51.880 --> 00:53.920
report of yourself.

00:53.920 --> 00:56.680
We call this your inner blueprint.

00:56.680 --> 01:03.560
It's the unique combination of your values, your strengths, your life experiences, and

01:03.560 --> 01:05.640
your energy patterns.

01:05.640 --> 01:11.960
The primary A.R.A.W. muscles we are conditioning in this lesson are your wellbeing through

01:11.960 --> 01:18.160
deep self-awareness and your resilience by learning from your past.

01:18.160 --> 01:24.460
In a world where change is constant, this is your inner and anchor core.

01:24.460 --> 01:30.180
The stronger your inner blueprint, the more agile you can become in uncertainty.

01:30.180 --> 01:36.660
This lesson is about giving yourself the room to gather the essential raw materials.

01:36.660 --> 01:42.420
This is what you'll need to architect your M.V.P. blueprint in our next lesson.

